Native DAVE adapter

The gateway callback mapping was informed by disgoorg/godave v0.3.0
golibdave/golibdave.go (Apache-2.0, godave contributors).
https://github.com/disgoorg/godave/tree/v0.3.0/golibdave

Modified implementation: direct native C API ownership, serialized operations,
strict no-passthrough media path, input budgets and duplicate-epoch nonce guard.
The official Discord libdave dependency is separately distributed under MIT
with its own third-party notices and is not included in this source directory.
